## Description

I love this opensource project!  Someone just put a 28.9M parameter AI model on an ESP32-S3.  A chip that costs only a few dollars.  No cloud. No API. No internet.  It runs locally at ~9.5 tokens/s and can generate stories on a tiny screen. This changes the way we think about AI https://t.co/qdhbbudlLf

